  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Reporting and documentation requirements",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Define > Assess the market",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation provides that contracting authorities are required to prepare written reports for every contract or framework agreement covered by the PCR 2015, and for every dynamic purchasing system established.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The report must include, among other information, the following:",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the contracting authority's name and address",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the subject-matter and value of the contract, framework agreement or dynamic purchasing system",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "results of qualitative selection (where applicable)",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "reasons for rejection of abnormally low tenders",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "the name of the successful supplier and reasons why its tender was selected",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "reasons for using certain procurement procedures",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "reasons for the contracting authority’s decision not to complete the procurement (where applicable)",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "reasons for using means of communication other than electronic for the submission of tenders",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "any conflicts of interest detected and mitigating measures that have been taken.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The report should also contain information about the progress of the procurement procedure, and, to that end, must contain information about: decisions taken in relation to communications with suppliers and internal deliberations, preparation of procurement documents, dialogue or negotiation with suppliers where relevant, and selection and award of the contract.",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The report must be kept for at least three years from the date of the contract award. There are also requirements to provide access to the report upon request by a relevant government authority (whether in England, Wales or Northern Ireland).",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Sufficient documentation must be kept by contracting authorities to justify all decisions taken in connection with the planning of the procurement process, including, amongst other issues, internal deliberations and the preparation of the procurement documents.",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that they keep a robust record of all decisions taken in connection with the planning of the procurement process",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure sufficient reporting processes are in place to record key decisions.",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "See also in the Procurement Act 2023:",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Section 98: Record-keeping",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Additional support and guidance",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Make sure you:",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00027",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "read the regulation",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00028",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "seek legal and commercial advice in the context of specific procurements",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "heading_path": [
        "Reporting and documentation requirements",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
